  "value": "groups is a list of tag lists (a tag may repeat inside a group) and filter is a list of distinct tags. A group is valid when it contains every tag of filter (so every group is valid when filter is empty). Return the distinct tags that appear in at least one valid group and are not in filter, sorted by code point (the source allows any order; sorting makes the answer unique).",
